        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R4310, Scroll 3 Inch x 10 Inch Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 Inch x 10 Inch Scroll Register with Damper is a great addition to any historic home. The lovely scroll design is elegant and makes this floor vent a work of art. It will fit any new or existing 3x10 floor opening. The Scroll 3 Inch x 10 Inch Register with Damper has a toggle so you can adjust the air flow into the room. Choose from 5 beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-10-inch-scroll-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r4410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Scroll Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-12-inch-scroll-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r4412\"<b>4 Inch x 12 Inch Scroll Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-14-inch-scroll-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r4414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Scroll Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Scroll 3 Inch x 10 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>.  See available <a href=\"/collections/vents-and-registers\"><b>Vents and Registers</b></a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
